    "proofs": [
      "TCommandsDataSource.Create0xf8cf2c explicitly sets bytes+0x14 and+0x15 to0; FormCreate0xf8b1d8 creates that data source.",
      "TNeoScene fresh allocation is zeroed by TObject.InitInstance0x60620c; InternalCreate0xc9a38c and AfterConstruction0xc99f68 leave LiveGroups+0x78 unchanged.",
      "LoadNeoScenes0xf88f34 copies retained NeoScene+0x78 into temporary Scene.LiveGroups+0x84. SetSelectedScene0xf88508 calls UpdateLiveScene0xf8ae10, clearing all Live states and taking selected state from actLiveScene.Checked.",
      "DFM actLiveScene/actSyncSliders/actUsePercent omit Checked; fresh TCustomAction.Create and allocation produce false. The admitted lifecycle excludes prior Live action selections.",
      "Execute0xf87c40 at0xf87cf4 resets actUsePercent.Checked=false, then executes the enabled action0xf87d20; actUsePercentExecute0xf8c27c togglestrue and calls SetUsePercent0xf8d1a4.",
      "Raw selection executes UsePercent action once after entry; percent selection keeps true. Explicit sync selection executes actSyncSliders0xf8c1dc once fromfalse; SetSyncLevels0xf8d188 sets byte+0x15."
    ]
  },
  "control_transition": {
